e limited company registered in Stavanger, founded 2002-09-10. BLIKK TEKNIKK AS produces gutters and flashings (takrenner og beslag) and ventilation systems (ventilasjonsanlegg). Its main industry code is 25.620: manufacture of locks and hinges. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 10 948 730 NOK and the annual result was 817 831 NOK; operating income was up from 9 911 900 NOK in 2024. The annual result rose from 152 951 NOK in 2024 to 817 831 NOK in 2025. Equity fell from 2 724 592 NOK in 2024 to 2 542 423 NOK in 2025. Its verified website is blikkteknikk.no. Recent changes in the register: employees set to 9 on 2026-04-15; business address set to Dokkgata 10 on 2026-03-11.","sentences":[{"text":"BLIKK TEKNIKK AS is a private limited company registered in Stavanger, founded 2002-09-10.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c7"]},{"text":"BLIKK TEKNIKK AS produces gutters and flashings (takrenner og beslag) and ventilation systems (ventilasjonsanlegg).","claim_ids":["c11","c10","c71"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 25.620: manufacture of locks and hinges.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 10 948 730 NOK and the annual result was 817 831 NOK; operating income was up from 9 911 900 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c47","c52","c36"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from 152 951 NOK in 2024 to 817 831 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c41","c52"]},{"text":"Equity fell from 2 724 592 NOK in 2024 to 2 542 423 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c44","c55"]},{"text":"Its verified website is blikkteknikk.no.","claim_ids":["c70"]},{"text":"Recent changes in the register: employees set to 9 on 2026-04-15; business address set to Dokkgata 10 on 2026-03-11.","claim_ids":["c65","c67"]}],"unknowns":["Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this organisation number as employer (index built 2026-11-07T08:17:35+00:00).","Social profiles: the verified website links to none.","Hiring: no open NAV job ads and no careers page on the verified w